WAMInfer

External inference code adapted around OpenWAM's inference interfaces.
Upstream: https://github.com/OpenWAM-Official/OpenWAM
Reference revision: 898e2f96c02c172f078c17ff85a055a6bbd419a2

The upstream Apache-2.0 license text is retained in LICENSE.
The WAMInfer source files are external adaptations, including branch scheduling,
prepared conditioning, graph replay, projection packing, and fused inference
operators. They are not unmodified copies of OpenWAM model definitions.
Upstream model source, checkpoints, and datasets are not distributed here.

The external-addon organization was informed by BAC:
https://github.com/ky-ji/BAC/tree/82029a6fb0573fd07f4b26088219b0eb5ccc5a67
BAC's approximate block-skipping method is not implemented by this package.
